# You are the brightest
# light known to me,
#
# you’re the reason why I try
# to dress well, like a man on a first date,
#
# you’re the reason why I started
# smiling again, like a kid with candy,
#
# you’re the reason I stay awake at night,
# wandering between delusions of the future, back and forth,
#
# you are the ray of light
# piercing through the grey clouds of my heart,
#
# you’re the reason I remembered
# the word admiration,
#
# you’re the reason why I felt
# love again.
#
# our journey might not go the way I wanted,
# my feelings for you might fade someday,
# but I promise I loved you like no one else did,
# I will always wish the best for you,
# and pretend not to be hurt,  
# even though I am.
